From 1f3be2e771a1e0944c2902f3046ad34e03a12da5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 09:24:07 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(post): carry flipped WCS axes with Z rotation

Conjugate the WCS yaw under an odd XY reflection and admit finite Z
rotations through app validation. Pin the physical controller trace,
viewer mapping, setup sheet and travel checks in both output modes.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2476
